### Zippy — API requests, version-controlled
### Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) and click
### "Send Request" above any block. Keeping these in the repo means our API
### calls are reviewed and diffed like code, not trapped in a separate app.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health — liveness plus a real check of Postgres and Redis.
### 200 with { status: "ok", db: true, redis: true } when both are up.
### 503 with the same shape (db or redis false) when a dependency is down —
### the process itself stays alive either way.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
